Perfect! I found the answer. Looking at the `memo_service.proto` file, the `CreateMemo` RPC is defined at lines 21-27:

```21:27:proto/api/v1/memo_service.proto
  rpc CreateMemo(CreateMemoRequest) returns (Memo) {
    option (google.api.http) = {
      post: "/api/v1/memos"
      body: "memo"
    };
    option (google.api.method_signature) = "memo";
  }
```

The HTTP method mapping for the CreateMemo RPC is specified in the `google.api.http` option, which indicates it uses the `post` method with the URL path `/api/v1/memos`.

